{"i":1,"start_s":5.27,"end_s":13.47,"speaker":"SPEAKER_00","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"afternoon I'm not used to being tethered to a podium or a mic so you'll have to forgive me I'm gonna be pretty loud but I"}
