{"i":4,"start_s":20.02,"end_s":20.97,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"but I have to be"}
{"i":5,"start_s":20.97,"end_s":28.28,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"honest when I got here this morning and many of you may have not been here this morning so let me paint a picture for you really quick"}
{"i":6,"start_s":28.24,"end_s":28.71,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"When I"}
{"i":7,"start_s":28.93,"end_s":56.02,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"parked across the street, there was a sea of school buses, like I was in some sort of school bus yard. But when I looked at all the names of the dozens and dozens of school buses, I could see all the different counties and school districts from around the state. And then when I walked into the stadium arena today, and I came up through the back and I looked out, this place was packed. Thousands upon thousands of high school students from around this state."}
{"i":8,"start_s":56.15,"end_s":84.55,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"We're here to engage about this problem, this academic, this crisis that we face today. How often do you see children engaging in something like that when it does not relate it to Snapchat or to Facebook? And these kids were engaged. They were excited. They were shouting. They were screaming. The energy was totally electric, and it really changed me. Hearing a lot of the stories today really changed a lot of what I wanted to talk"}
{"i":9,"start_s":84.7,"end_s":85.09,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":true,"text":"about."}
{"i":10,"start_s":85.07,"end_s":85.35,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"But I"}
{"i":11,"start_s":85.46,"end_s":112.78,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"have to first say thank you to Senator Mike Lee and his vision for this. I told him earlier that I believe that this should be in every arena across this country. And the great people in this state of Utah that have put this together, from the AG, Sean Reyes, and the local DEA, Brian Besser, what an amazing job. So I just want you to know the energy in here this morning was electric, and we must continue"}
{"i":12,"start_s":112.9,"end_s":113.74,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"that."}
{"i":13,"start_s":113.73,"end_s":114.31,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"So,"}
{"i":14,"start_s":114.72,"end_s":117.81,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"yeah, thank you. Yes."}
{"i":15,"start_s":117.81,"end_s":120.3,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"It's not just"}
{"i":16,"start_s":120.3,"end_s":129.37,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Senator Lee's and the Attorney General's and the DEA's responsibility to continue it. It's all of our responsibility to continue it. So I appreciate you engaging"}
{"i":17,"start_s":129.88,"end_s":130.67,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"with that."}
{"i":18,"start_s":130.67,"end_s":131.58,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And so for me,"}
{"i":19,"start_s":131.69,"end_s":136.16,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"this started a couple months ago. I was actually in the Attorney General's"}
{"i":20,"start_s":136.24,"end_s":136.9,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"office here"}
{"i":21,"start_s":136.91,"end_s":141.82,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"and he got a shipment of hats in and it's the hat I'm wearing right"}
{"i":22,"start_s":141.82,"end_s":142.09,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"now."}
{"i":23,"start_s":142.08,"end_s":142.48,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And when"}
{"i":24,"start_s":142.52,"end_s":144.12,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"I looked at the hat, I said to him,"}
{"i":25,"start_s":144.2,"end_s":144.6,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"\"Hey,"}
{"i":26,"start_s":144.6,"end_s":155,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"that's a pretty powerful thing. What does instead mean? I like that.\" And if you know me, you know that every day, I wear the same outfit, the same color pants, the same exact"}
{"i":27,"start_s":155.07,"end_s":160.96,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"shoes, the same t-shirt, seven days a week. And I wear the same hat, probably have 20 copies of the same hat."}
{"i":28,"start_s":160.96,"end_s":161.36,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"But for"}
{"i":29,"start_s":161.42,"end_s":165.7,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"the first time in a long time, when I saw that word instead, it was so powerful"}
{"i":30,"start_s":165.66,"end_s":165.73,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"I"}
{"i":31,"start_s":165.96,"end_s":182.93,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"asked the Attorney General A, \"Can I have the hat?\" And when he explained to me what was going on here today, I said, \"I gotta be involved.\" And so thanks to Sean Reyes for inviting me, thanks for the hat that I've been rocking around the United States as I travel and engaging with technology leaders from Silicon Valley and"}
{"i":32,"start_s":183.14,"end_s":189.4,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"across this land to understand about how we in the technology industry can do better. That we can do better"}
{"i":33,"start_s":189.4,"end_s":189.92,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"to help."}
{"i":34,"start_s":189.92,"end_s":194.2,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"The technology that's available today and that's coming available, it's so powerful."}
{"i":35,"start_s":194.36,"end_s":194.37,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":true,"text":"and"}
{"i":36,"start_s":194.38,"end_s":203.12,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"we use it for so many different things, but we should be using it to eradicate the opioid epidemic. And so,"}
{"i":37,"start_s":203.21,"end_s":203.93,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"this is"}
{"i":38,"start_s":203.93,"end_s":217.01,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"super powerful and meaningful to me, in the sense that someone very close to me, like a lot of the stories you've heard today, had to be resuscitated multiple"}
{"i":39,"start_s":217.01,"end_s":217.58,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"times and"}
{"i":40,"start_s":217.79,"end_s":222.08,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"brought back from the opioids. Now, this was before we knew we had an opioid crisis."}
{"i":41,"start_s":222.3,"end_s":224.88,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"This is before when people were talking"}
{"i":42,"start_s":224.88,"end_s":225.56,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"about it."}
{"i":43,"start_s":225.78,"end_s":229.76,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"But that experience shaped me, and it has motivated me."}
{"i":44,"start_s":230.02,"end_s":233.48,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"You know, about eight years"}
{"i":45,"start_s":233.52,"end_s":234.03,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"ago,"}
{"i":46,"start_s":234.03,"end_s":243.92,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"I started this company, Banjo, in Silicon Valley. And I'm not your average tech guy out of Silicon Valley. In fact, before I was in Silicon Valley, I was"}
{"i":47,"start_s":243.92,"end_s":247.02,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"in law enforcement. And I did two tours"}
{"i":48,"start_s":247.02,"end_s":247.71,"speaker":"SPEAKER_08","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"of duty in"}
{"i":49,"start_s":247.72,"end_s":248.2,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"war,"}
{"i":50,"start_s":248.2,"end_s":248.73,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"in the"}
{"i":51,"start_s":249.4,"end_s":249.88,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"military."}
{"i":52,"start_s":250.6,"end_s":252.59,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"But I knew... Thank you"}
{"i":53,"start_s":252.59,"end_s":255.09,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"very much. But when I first"}
{"i":54,"start_s":255.5,"end_s":271.78,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"invented this technology, which has become one of the leading artificial intelligence companies in the world, I knew it had a greater purpose. And today at Banjo, there's a lot of ways, like other tech companies, that we could be focused in areas that are, quite"}
{"i":55,"start_s":271.78,"end_s":277.25,"speaker":"SPEAKER_05","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"honestly, easy to make money. Easy for us to succeed."}
{"i":56,"start_s":277.26,"end_s":277.67,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"But"}
{"i":57,"start_s":277.85,"end_s":283.36,"speaker":"SPEAKER_05","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"when you see what this technology and other technologies around us can do,"}
{"i":58,"start_s":283.42,"end_s":283.75,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"I'm"}
{"i":59,"start_s":284.01,"end_s":306.9,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"calling on all of us technical leaders to be more altruistic with our technology and to help, not just with the opioid crisis, but in all the human crises. Because we have one of the greatest abilities to make the difference. And we need to stand up and to do our part. And so today, as you heard before,"}
{"i":60,"start_s":306.85,"end_s":307.65,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"I've moved the"}
{"i":61,"start_s":307.68,"end_s":325.19,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"headquarters of our company to Utah. Why? Well, Utah, as you know, is leading here in the opioid crisis, showing leadership with Senator Lee, putting together a conference, but also, unfortunately, leading on the bad side of"}
{"i":62,"start_s":325.39,"end_s":325.74,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"it with"}
{"i":63,"start_s":325.76,"end_s":334.51,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"the opioid epidemic. And we have to make a difference. And I've challenged my company that we will use our artificial intelligence"}
{"i":64,"start_s":334.67,"end_s":334.68,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"and"}
{"i":65,"start_s":334.71,"end_s":337.73,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"the power that we have, only for good."}
{"i":66,"start_s":337.97,"end_s":340.97,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"We are on a mission. Our"}
{"i":67,"start_s":341,"end_s":342.79,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"company's mission is to save"}
{"i":68,"start_s":343.06,"end_s":343.65,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"human life"}
{"i":69,"start_s":343.95,"end_s":358.41,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"and to reduce suffering, period. If our technology is not being used for that, we will not use it, regardless of the money, regardless of any of the good that could come out of it. It has to be used for saving human life. We have to make the difference."}
{"i":70,"start_s":358.5,"end_s":358.69,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And there"}
{"i":71,"start_s":359.05,"end_s":382.66,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"are other companies besides us who are making a difference. There are other companies who are dedicated, not just to the opioid crisis, but to making good. Here, you guys know you have a great company called Pluralsight, and with Pluralsight One, teaching young people and giving them skills so as they come up they can focus and lead a path, another choice, instead of going down one road, instead they can choose another."}
{"i":72,"start_s":382.69,"end_s":383.06,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Social"}
{"i":73,"start_s":383.21,"end_s":387.99,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"media companies like Facebook get beat up a lot. And for some times there's"}
{"i":74,"start_s":387.99,"end_s":389.03,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"a good reason."}
{"i":75,"start_s":389.21,"end_s":393.11,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"But Facebook is doing a lot of good around the opioid crisis and"}
{"i":76,"start_s":393.33,"end_s":393.4,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"has a"}
{"i":77,"start_s":393.41,"end_s":409.63,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"program to try to curb and understand when it's being talked about and where the problem is and sharing that. Companies like Microsoft are using the power of their cloud technology with partnerships in order to help understand where drugs are being over-prescribed."}
{"i":78,"start_s":409.58,"end_s":410.42,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And so I want to"}
{"i":79,"start_s":410.65,"end_s":435.46,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"thank those leaders and those companies and I want to thank all the employees in my company who've come along on this mission with me to help eradicate this problem. Many of you have heard today and many of you missed this morning the powerful speakers who've all experienced a tragedy and a problem with the opioid crisis. Many of you in this audience, I assure"}
{"i":80,"start_s":435.46,"end_s":435.76,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":true,"text":"you."}
{"i":81,"start_s":435.74,"end_s":436,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Your"}
{"i":82,"start_s":436.11,"end_s":458.59,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"neighbors, to your left or to your right, have experienced the pain of what this epidemic has caused. And the other day, I happened to be at a barbecue here in Utah. I'm not the most social person in the world. In fact, I usually hide behind the scenes, pretty much like I have the company's name Banjo hidden behind my beard."}
{"i":83,"start_s":458.97,"end_s":460.49,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"But at this"}
{"i":84,"start_s":460.49,"end_s":465.56,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"meeting, there were rock stars, movie stars,"}
{"i":85,"start_s":466.23,"end_s":469.09,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"sports stars so I already felt out of place and"}
{"i":86,"start_s":469.09,"end_s":469.87,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"I wanted to get"}
{"i":87,"start_s":470.01,"end_s":475.48,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"out of there but I found myself staying till the end of the event which is rare and I'm glad"}
{"i":88,"start_s":475.83,"end_s":476.46,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"I did"}
{"i":89,"start_s":476.54,"end_s":477.97,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"because what I heard there"}
{"i":90,"start_s":477.97,"end_s":478.76,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"will stick"}
{"i":91,"start_s":478.76,"end_s":490.34,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"with me for the rest of my life but also has motivated not only myself but motivates my team and the growing team that we continue to hire throughout Utah to help eradicate the opioid epidemic"}
{"i":92,"start_s":490.94,"end_s":491.66,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And in that"}
{"i":93,"start_s":491.76,"end_s":497.89,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"meeting I met this gentleman and he came up to me and I actually thought he was a movie star and I didn't know who he was and I was sort"}
{"i":94,"start_s":497.99,"end_s":503.88,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"of embarrassed. And he started talking about his son and he had a picture of his son and he was so proud of him and"}
{"i":95,"start_s":503.95,"end_s":512.48,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"he was talking about him. And his son was in his 20s and then he told me that his son had died recently of an opioid overdose."}
{"i":96,"start_s":512.48,"end_s":513.52,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And he told"}
{"i":97,"start_s":513.52,"end_s":518.88,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"me that his neighbors, his friends, his work colleagues, everybody said, wait a"}
{"i":98,"start_s":518.96,"end_s":519.48,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"minute,"}
{"i":99,"start_s":519.46,"end_s":528.96,"speaker":"SPEAKER_05","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"\"Your son was a junkie? Your son was on drugs? That doesn't make any sense.\" And he said to me, \"What does someone on opioids"}
{"i":100,"start_s":528.96,"end_s":532.28,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"look like?\" And again, he showed me the picture of"}
{"i":101,"start_s":532.28,"end_s":532.72,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"his son,"}
{"i":102,"start_s":532.72,"end_s":538.22,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"who I can tell you was a handsome young man, successful in his work, successful in his"}
{"i":103,"start_s":538.22,"end_s":539.29,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"family life."}
{"i":104,"start_s":539.6,"end_s":545.77,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And he said, \"He looks like me. He looks like you. He looks like"}
{"i":105,"start_s":545.77,"end_s":547.52,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"all of us.\""}
{"i":106,"start_s":547.57,"end_s":549.07,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"There's not a stereotype"}
{"i":107,"start_s":549.12,"end_s":565.94,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And we cannot stereotype. We have to come together as a community and help those in need. And those that are in need, and I know there are some in this audience right now, and many of you are saying, well, these are mostly business leaders in this audience. I can assure you, there are people in this audience right now"}
{"i":108,"start_s":565.94,"end_s":566.22,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"that need"}
{"i":109,"start_s":566.59,"end_s":573.52,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"our help and our support. I am here for you. This community is here"}
{"i":110,"start_s":573.53,"end_s":574.33,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"for you."}
{"i":111,"start_s":574.33,"end_s":579.05,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"I know I have seen the effects on the dark side of this, but I have also seen what is coming."}
{"i":112,"start_s":578.99,"end_s":579.07,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"I"}
{"i":113,"start_s":579.26,"end_s":583.79,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"have seen the technology that it's going to allow us to get ahead of this problem for the first time."}
{"i":114,"start_s":584.06,"end_s":584.97,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And I know that"}
{"i":115,"start_s":585.12,"end_s":588.87,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"it may seem dark for you, and it may seem hard,"}
{"i":116,"start_s":589.12,"end_s":589.37,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"but the"}
{"i":117,"start_s":589.37,"end_s":593.33,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"bravest thing that you can do is ask for help."}
{"i":118,"start_s":593.6,"end_s":595.29,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"And so for"}
{"i":119,"start_s":595.35,"end_s":607.33,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"all of you in attendance today as business leaders around the state, I challenge you to keep an open mind and not to"}
{"i":120,"start_s":607.81,"end_s":608.05,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"judge."}
{"i":121,"start_s":608.05,"end_s":608.32,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"We're"}
{"i":122,"start_s":608.45,"end_s":615.59,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"not going to judge these folks that need help. We're going to embrace them because it's the only way that we're going to solve this problem. And"}
{"i":123,"start_s":615.75,"end_s":616.83,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"we will solve"}
{"i":124,"start_s":616.83,"end_s":622.94,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"this problem. Not because we want to, but because we have to."}
{"i":125,"start_s":623.35,"end_s":624.86,"speaker":null,"speaker_conf":"none","speaker_cause":"no_turn_overlap","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Thank you very"}
{"i":126,"start_s":624.92,"end_s":626.05,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"much."}
